// alias (lowercase) -> { league, espnAbbr, full }
//
// Known limitation, pre-existing and not introduced by the college football
// addition: a handful of bare city-name aliases are ambiguous between a pro
// team and a college team (e.g. 'cincinnati' -> Bengals, not Bearcats;
// 'texas' -> Rangers, not Longhorns). matchTeams() in
// lib/market-source-profiles.js only ever picks one winner per alias, and
// the existing pro-league mapping was left in place rather than overwritten,
// since pro sports resolution is the more established, higher-volume path.
// A college game only resolves correctly today if the question includes the
// full school name (e.g. "Cincinnati Bearcats", not bare "Cincinnati") or a
// non-colliding school name (most of them — only ~23 of 762 collide). See
